9. She has visited a Pokémon pop-up shop in London, though it had long queues. (Verbatim: "i remember they did like a pop-up shop in london and i actually went to go i actually went to go to the one in london um it was like there for like a limited time um i don't know if they've made one since i could probably i should probably check um but when i did try and go to the pop-up one um the queue for the pokemon center was like two hours or longer and it was really busy and it was really small")
